# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Fuji F-Log2
# Cameras  : X-H2S, X-H2, GFX100S II
# Input    : Fuji F-Log2 log / F-Gamut
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  F-Gamut → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.600 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.529 – 0.539
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.457 – 0.467
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.386 – 0.396
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.319 – 0.328
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.257 – 0.265
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.100
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Fuji F-Log2"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

